uff, it happens for free and you can stack them. So like MD hover, which me=
ans only on a tablet ish device only only when they're hovering, have this =
background color and instead of like the pseudo selector of colon hover and=
 then also the media query inside of that, you get to skip all of that.

[00:01:52]
