[00:01:47]
Maybe it's something where it's got a tab index so they can tab to it, righ=
t? But for people with a mouse, I don't want to just because they clicked o=
n a card or a table row or whatever, show that border. Focus is not going t=
o do what you want because it's always going to show whenever they've anyth=
